<p>Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy visited Doha on March 28 and signed a defense cooperation pact with Qatar as part of a Gulf tour that also produced an air defense agreement with the United Arab Emirates. DW said the Qatar pact covers high-tech cooperation and the sharing of battlefield experience in countering missile and drone threats. Broader coverage cast the tour as an effort to deepen Ukraine&#x27;s security ties with Gulf states during a period of regional escalation.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/xITcBzZu5JEOUUQmJSyYWS35okMXjEbGX6t7h2HiPPuJqVOgVcVhuy0zyz7P44tzvd3Jb6rZKqTofuh8GxUNjsY9vjd0yXrjUPdJVl2FkCZCC8MdLMuPoibZdAig_LG-uTVAeApmJDGAnSHwrnudi30LUm4LgVvwAdUFaU8xge00FGEBbbEDVBB-EqRL8ztyRvJGNpxpN5r0Xl212mQ' alt='In a photo released by the Ukrainian Presidential Press Service, President Volodymyr Zelensky, in black, and Emir Sheikh Tamim bin Hamad al-Thani of Qatar walk together during their meeting in Doha on March 28, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Combat credibility: Al Jazeera said Kyiv is drawing on expertise from downing Russian drones, giving its offer live-fire credibility instead of relying on peacetime testing claims.</li><li>Role reversal: The New York Times said Zelenskyy&#x27;s tour aimed to present Ukraine as a supplier of defense capability, not just a recipient of military aid.</li><li>Diplomatic gamble: Al-Monitor described the outreach as risky for Kyiv because deeper Gulf defense ties could affect relations across a region with competing alignments.</li><li>Long horizon: Some coverage portrayed the arrangements as decade-long, an unusually long commitment for a country still fighting a major war.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Ukraine government: Kyiv framed the tour as proof that methods refined under sustained Russian attack can become exportable defense cooperation and broader strategic ties beyond Europe. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/28/zelenskyy-signs-air-defence-deals-with-uae-qatar-on-gulf-tour'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>Gulf states: Their interest reflects a push to widen the pool of defense partners as missile and drone threats become a more immediate regional security problem. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/inside-story/2026/3/28/could-ukraines-drone-expertise-serve-gulf-countries'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>Analysts cited by Al-Monitor: They described the arms diplomacy as a tightrope for Ukraine because new Gulf defense ties could complicate relations in a region where states maintain different links with Iran and other powers. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/risky-moment-ukraine-treads-tightrope-gulf-arms-deals'>Al-Monitor</a>)</li><li>US-focused wire coverage: ABC framed the visit mainly as a practical counter-drone discussion for Gulf Arab states facing attacks linked to Iran, more than as a symbolic diplomatic trip. (<a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/nighttime-strikes-kill-5-ukraine-zelenskyy-discusses-drone-131497906'>ABC News</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/zelenskyy-visits-doha-as-ukraine-qatar-sign-defense-pact/a-76578423'>Zelenskyy visits Doha as Ukraine, Qatar sign defense pact</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/inside-story/2026/3/28/could-ukraines-drone-expertise-serve-gulf-countries'>Could Ukraine’s drone expertise serve Gulf countries?</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/risky-moment-ukraine-treads-tightrope-gulf-arms-deals'>&#x27;Risky moment&#x27;: Ukraine treads tightrope with Gulf arms deals</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-zelensky-ukraine-drone-defence-mideast-alliances/'>Zelensky visits Gulf Arab states to discuss drone defence, seek strategic ties</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/middle-east/article/3348273/irans-drones-swarm-gulf-ukraines-wartime-tech-lands-billion-dollar-deals'>As Iran’s drones swarm Gulf, Ukraine’s wartime tech lands billion-dollar deals</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/nighttime-strikes-kill-5-ukraine-zelenskyy-discusses-drone-131497906'>Zelenskyy visits Gulf Arab states to talk drone defense</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/28/world/europe/ukraine-air-defense-deal-qatar-saudi-arabia.html'>Ukraine Finalizes Air Defense Deals With Gulf Nations Amid War in Mideast</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/worldnews/comments/1s69i4c/ukraine_securing_10year_defense_deals_with_gulf/'>Ukraine securing 10-year defense deals with Gulf states amid Iran war</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thenews.pk/story/1406868-zelensky-agrees-air-defence-cooperation-with-uae-qatar-on-gulf-tour'>Qatar and Ukraine sign a defense pact that includes cooperation on countering missile and drone threats.</a> - thenews.pk</li></ul>